// One param, carried by the Graceful pieces.

// WHOLE PERCENT added to natural run energy recovery. The engine sums it over WORN equipment in
// calculateRunWeight() - the same pass, at the same moments, as the run weight - and applies it in
// updateEnergy() to the natural recovery only. An energy potion is not scaled by it, because a
// potion is not you catching your breath.
//
// It is deliberately a plain number rather than a "graceful" flag: the engine knows nothing about
// which outfit this is, so anything else that should help you recover just carries the param. And
// it is read from the worn objs every time worn equipment changes rather than cached in a varp,
// which is the difference between a number that cannot go stale and one that can.
[energy_restore]
type=int
default=0
